y to attack rolls with that weapon).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Armors:"]}," Verpine Armor and Shields provide ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," 10 against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"}," damage. However, Verpine Armor is designed for the Verpine's unique physiology, and they require the wearer have a minimum ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," score of 13+ to wear the armor effectively (otherwise, the wearer suffers from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor Check Penalties"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor_Check_Penalties"},").\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
